// Pico W keyboard injector - BLE GATT service definition.
//
// Mirrors the Android client (BleManager.kt):
//   Service UUID:        19B10000-E8F2-537E-4F6C-D104768A1214
//   TX Characteristic:   19B10001-E8F2-537E-4F6C-D104768A1214
//                        (WRITE / WRITE_WITHOUT_RESPONSE)
//
// The Android app writes application-layer frames (TYPE/MESSAGE_ID/SEQ/PAYLOAD)
// to the TX characteristic; this firmware receives them and injects the
// resulting characters over USB HID. The value is DYNAMIC: BTstack forwards
// every write to att_write_callback() at runtime.

PRIMARY_SERVICE, 19B10000-E8F2-537E-4F6C-D104768A1214
CHARACTERISTIC, 19B10001-E8F2-537E-4F6C-D104768A1214, READ | WRITE | WRITE_WITHOUT_RESPONSE | DYNAMIC, , TX
